# warnings

## DEFERRED_EXTERNAL_EVALUATED_EAGERLY

```text
[DEFERRED_EXTERNAL_EVALUATED_EAGERLY] The external module "ext-dyn" evaluates when its chunk loads, not when the deferred module evaluates. "main.js" defers "e.js", and "e.js" imports "ext-dyn". ESM output loads each external module at the start of the chunk that imports it. To evaluate "ext-dyn" lazily, bundle it, or use the CommonJS output format, which loads it with `require()` in the deferred code. CommonJS output works only when the runtime supports CommonJS and the module can load with `require()`.

```

## DEFERRED_EXTERNAL_EVALUATED_EAGERLY

```text
[DEFERRED_EXTERNAL_EVALUATED_EAGERLY] The external module "ext-lazy" evaluates when its chunk loads, not when the deferred module evaluates. "main.js" defers "d.js", and "d.js" imports "ext-lazy". ESM output loads each external module at the start of the chunk that imports it. To evaluate "ext-lazy" lazily, bundle it, or use the CommonJS output format, which loads it with `require()` in the deferred code. CommonJS output works only when the runtime supports CommonJS and the module can load with `require()`.

```

# Assets

## e.js

```js
import { n as __esmMin, r as __exportAll, t as __deferNs } from "./rolldown-runtime.js";
import "ext-dyn";
// e.js
var e_exports = /* @__PURE__ */ __exportAll({ e: () => 1 });
var e_deferred = /* @__PURE__ */ __deferNs(() => (init_e(), e_exports), e_exports);
var e;
function init_e() {
	return (init_e = __esmMin((() => {
		e = 1;
	})))();
}
export { e, e_exports as n, init_e as r, e_deferred as t };

```

## main.js

```js
import { n as __esmMin } from "./rolldown-runtime.js";
import { value } from "ext-lazy";
// d.js
var x;
function init_d() {
	return (init_d = __esmMin((() => {
		x = value;
	})))();
}
// main.js
const read = () => (init_d(), x);
const loadE = () => (async (n) => (n = await import("./e.js"), n.t))();
const loadOther = () => import("./other.js");
export { loadE, loadOther, read };

```

